WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.457
Welcome to Harbour and Co.

2
00:00:02.507 --> 00:00:04.769
Here's what your first week looks like.

3
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.087
On Monday, you'll meet your team and your buddy.

4
00:00:10.137 --> 00:00:12.026
Midweek is tools training.

5
00:00:12.076 --> 00:00:18.413
On Thursday, you'll shadow a customer call, and Friday ends with a check-in with your manager.

6
00:00:19.513 --> 00:00:22.331
Everything we do comes back to three values.

7
00:00:22.381 --> 00:00:23.852
Customers first.

8
00:00:23.902 --> 00:00:24.966
Own the outcome.

9
00:00:25.016 --> 00:00:26.454
Keep it simple.

10
00:00:27.913 --> 00:00:29.187
Stuck on anything?

11
00:00:29.237 --> 00:00:33.680
Your buddy is your first stop, and the people team is always one message away.

12
00:00:33.730 --> 00:00:35.179
Welcome aboard.

